HOW OUR AUDIT ADDRESSED THE KEY AUDIT MA:
We performed the following audit procedures:
• We obtained an understanding of the Group’s IFRS 9
implementation process including governance over the
implementation process;
• We reviewed the Group’s updated accounting policies for
compliance with IFRS 9;
• We assessed and tested key modelling assumptions for
reasonableness;
• We validated key inputs into the ECL model against source
documents and reports and checked for mathematical accuracy;
and
• We checked the financial statement disclosures for compliance
with IFRS 9.
